      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat actually throws all video requests to yt-dlp\n\nMaybe you can replace VRChat's yt-dlp with one from the project?\n\n%appdata%\\..\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Tools on windows. \n\nI've read that VRChat should be opened first, and then the yt-dlp.exe replaced, also heard that you may need to change file properties to mark yt-dlp.exe as readonly to make VRChat not replace it",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
