      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}Yes, you are quite right; in fact, most websites that work with yt-dlp can play normally in VRChat, including Xiaohongshu, AcFun (another Chinese bullet-chat video site), and even CCTV. However, VRChat's modified version of yt-dlp seems to deliberately block Bilibili; when a Bilibili link is entered, there is no response at all, even though it works normally in the original yt-dlp.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
